    "text": "A data consists of <math><mi>n</mi></math> observations: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo stretchy=\"true\">&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></math>, then the standard deviation of this data is",
